  "body": "## 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- **Windows: attachments and file inputs work again.** Since 0.24.1, every file read or write through the confined file opener failed on Windows with `PermissionError: [Errno 13]`. This broke Jira attachment upload and download by path, Confluence attachments, and `content_file`. Windows now opens the file by path with the same boundary and symlink checks. Linux and macOS keep the directory-anchored open (#1832, #1835). Thanks to @Fabbul for the report and @PerryLink for the fix.\n- **Tests: macOS.** `test_stdio_keeps_wide_cwd` no longer fails on macOS, where `/etc` is a symlink (#1830). Thanks to @mhollingsworth-cs.\n",
